<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom Inc raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom Inc raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it raised its rating on WorldCom Inc to strong buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Kevin Moore was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of WorldCom, which announced Monday it had agreed to merge with MFS Communications Inc in a stock swap worth at least $14 billion, were down 4-3/4 at 21-1/4 and topped the Nasdaq most active list.</p>
</text>
